# Qwen3.8-27B UD-IQ4_XS (13.3 GiB, KLD 0.024 vs Q8_0) + MTP (5-token probabilistic drafts, 64K draft vocab) + ngram-mod,
# 64K f16 ctx, host prompt cache. Chat 40.6 / code 46.8-47.4 / agentic edits 76-80 tok/s; needle 15/15, agentic 5/5
# (2026-10-15, qwen27b/README.md).
MODEL_SOURCE="-m /models/Qwen3.8-27B/Qwen3.8-27B-UD-IQ4_XS.gguf"
MODEL_ALIAS=qwen3.8-27b
# MODEL_IMAGE: a llama-server build of llama.cpp 529ac893e + patches/llama.cpp-q27 (Vulkan)
MODEL_ARGS="--jinja -ngl 99 -fa on -c 65536 --parallel 1 --cache-ram 16384 --spec-type draft-mtp,ngram-mod -md /models/Qwen3.8-27B/mtp-Qwen3.8-27B-Q4_0.gguf -ngld 99 --spec-draft-sampling probabilistic --spec-draft-n-max 5 --spec-draft-vocab /models/Qwen3.8-27B/qwen-dv-65536.bin"
